SWEET dev overlay (patch 0117): copies files from a payload RAM disk into the mounted root before launchd.
Inert unless boot-arg sweetdev=1|restore AND a RAMDisk memdev starts with a SWEETDEV archive. Format, path allowlist and the RAM disk lookup
(IOKitBSDInit.cpp:753-764 builds the memdev inside vfs_mountroot; mdevgetrange() after it) are documented in the header of bsd/dev/sweet_devoverlay.c below.
Adds sweet_vfs_rename/sweet_vfs_mkdir wrappers in vfs_syscalls.c (renameat_internal/mkdir1at are static). Hardware-writing path: unreviewed.

